1168	  font-family: var(--font-mono);
1169	  font-size: 10px;
1170	  font-weight: 500;
1171	  padding: 2px 7px;
1172	  border-radius: 4px;
1173	  background: var(--node-a-dim);
1174	  color: var(--node-a);
1175	}
1176	```
1177	
1178	## Lists Inside Nodes
1179	
1180	For tool listings, feature lists, table columns:
1181	
1182	```css
1183	.node-list {
1184	  list-style: none;
1185	  padding: 0;
1186	  margin: 0;
1187	  font-size: 12px;
1188	  line-height: 1.8;
1189	}
1190	
1191	.node-list li {
1192	  padding-left: 14px;
1193	  position: relative;
1194	}
1195	
1196	.node-list li::before {
1197	  content: '›';
1198	  color: var(--text-dim);
1199	  font-weight: 600;
1200	  position: absolute;
1201	  left: 0;
1202	}
1203	
1204	.node-list code {
1205	  font-family: var(--font-mono);
1206	  font-size: 11px;
1207	  background: var(--accent-dim);
1208	  color: var(--accent);
1209	  padding: 1px 5px;
1210	  border-radius: 3px;
1211	}
1212	```
1213	
1214	## KPI / Metric Cards
1215	
1216	Large hero number with trend indicator and label. For dashboards, review summaries, and impact sections.
1217	
1218	```css
1219	.kpi-row {
1220	  display: grid;
1221	  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
1222	  gap: 16px;
1223	}
1224	
1225	.kpi-card {
1226	  background: var(--surface-elevated);
1227	  border: 1px solid var(--border);
1228	  border-radius: 10px;
1229	  padding: 20px;
1230	  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
1231	}
1232	
1233	.kpi-card__value {
1234	  font-size: 36px;
1235	  font-weight: 700;
1236	  letter-spacing: -1px;
1237	  line-height: 1.1;
1238	  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
1239	}
1240	
1241	.kpi-card__label {
1242	  font-family: var(--font-mono);
1243	  font-size: 10px;
1244	  font-weight: 600;
1245	  text-transform: uppercase;
1246	  letter-spacing: 1.5px;
1247	  color: var(--text-dim);
1248	  margin-top: 6px;
1249	}
1250	
1251	.kpi-card__trend {
1252	  font-family: var(--font-mono);
1253	  font-size: 12px;
1254	  margin-top: 4px;
1255	}
1256	
1257	.kpi-card__trend--up { color: var(--node-b, #059669); }
1258	.kpi-card__trend--down { color: var(--red, #ef4444); }
1259	```
1260	
1261	```html
1262	<div class="kpi-row">
1263	  <div class="kpi-card">
1264	    <div class="kpi-card__value">247</div>
1265	    <div class="kpi-card__label">Lines Added</div>
1266	    <div class="kpi-card__trend kpi-card__trend--up">+34%</div>
1267	  </div>
1268	  <!-- ... more cards -->
1269	</div>
1270	```
1271	
1272	## Before / After Panels
1273	
1274	Two-column comparison with diff-colored headers. For review pages, migration docs, and feature comparisons.
1275	
1276	```css
1277	.diff-panels {
1278	  display: grid;
1279	  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
1280	  gap: 0;
1281	  border: 1px solid var(--border);
1282	  border-radius: 10px;
1283	  overflow: hidden;
1284	}
1285	
1286	.diff-panels > * { min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: break-word; }
1287	
1288	.diff-panel__header {
1289	  font-family: var(--font-mono);
1290	  font-size: 11px;
1291	  font-weight: 600;
1292	  text-transform: uppercase;
1293	  letter-spacing: 1px;
1294	  padding: 10px 16px;
1295	}
1296	
1297	.diff-panel__header--before {
1298	  background: var(--red-dim, rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.08));
1299	  color: var(--red, #ef4444);
1300	  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--red, #ef4444);
1301	}
1302	
1303	.diff-panel__header--after {
1304	  background: var(--green-dim, rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.08));
1305	  color: var(--green, #059669);
1306	  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--green, #059669);
1307	}
1308	
1309	.diff-panel__body {
1310	  padding: 16px;
1311	  background: var(--surface);
1312	  font-size: 13px;
1313	  line-height: 1.6;
1314	}
1315	
1316	/* Highlight changed items within a panel */
1317	.diff-changed {
1318	  background: var(--accent-dim);
1319	  border-radius: 3px;
1320	  padding: 0 3px;
1321	}
1322	
1323	@media (max-width: 768px) {
1324	  .diff-panels { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
1325	}
1326	```
1327	
1328	```html
1329	<div class="diff-panels">
1330	  <div class="diff-panel__header diff-panel__header--before">Before</div>
1331	  <div class="diff-panel__header diff-panel__header--after">After</div>
1332	  <div class="diff-panel__body">Previous implementation...</div>
1333	  <div class="diff-panel__body">New implementation...</div>
1334	</div>
1335	```
1336	
1337	## Collapsible Sections
1338	
1339	Native `<details>/<summary>` with styled disclosure. Zero JS, accessible. For lower-priority content: file maps, decision logs, reference sections.
1340	
1341	```css
1342	details.collapsible {
1343	  border: 1px solid var(--border);
1344	  border-radius: 10px;
1345	  overflow: hidden;
1346	}
1347	
1348	details.collapsible summary {
1349	  padding: 14px 20px;
1350	  background: var(--surface);
1351	  font-family: var(--font-mono);
1352	  font-size: 12px;
1353	  font-weight: 600;
1354	  cursor: pointer;
1355	  list-style: none;
1356	  display: flex;
1357	  align-items: center;
1358	  gap: 8px;
1359	  color: var(--text);
1360	  transition: background 0.15s ease;
1361	}
1362	
1363	details.collapsible summary:hover {
1364	  background: var(--surface-elevated, var(--surface));
1365	}
1366	
1367	details.collapsible summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
1368	
1369	/* Chevron indicator */
1370	details.collapsible summary::before {
1371	  content: '▸';
1372	  font-size: 11px;
1373	  color: var(--text-dim);
1374	  transition: transform 0.15s ease;
1375	}
1376	
1377	details.collapsible[open] summary::before {
1378	  transform: rotate(90deg);
1379	}
1380	
1381	details.collapsible .collapsible__body {
1382	  padding: 16px 20px;
1383	  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
1384	  font-size: 13px;
1385	  line-height: 1.6;
1386	}
1387	```
1388	
1389	```html
1390	<details class="collapsible">
1391	  <summary>File Map (14 files changed)</summary>
1392	  <div class="collapsible__body">
1393	    <!-- content here -->
1394	  </div>
1395	</details>
1396	```
1397	
1398	## Prose Page Elements
1399	
1400	Patterns for documentation, articles, blog posts, and other reading-first content. The key difference from visual explanations: optimize for sustained reading, not scanning.
1401	
1402	### Body Text Settings
1403	
1404	```css
1405	/* Comfortable reading baseline */
1406	.prose {
1407	  font-size: clamp(17px, 1.1vw + 14px, 19px);
1408	  line-height: 1.7;
1409	  max-width: 65ch;  /* ~600-680px */
1410	  text-wrap: pretty;
1411	}
1412	
1413	.prose p {
1414	  margin-bottom: 1.5em;
1415	}
1416	
1417	/* Narrow column for essays/literary content */
1418	.prose--narrow {
1419	  max-width: 60ch;
1420	  line-height: 1.8;
1421	}
1422	
1423	/* Wide column for technical content with code */
1424	.prose--wide {
1425	  max-width: 75ch;
1426	  line-height: 1.6;
1427	}
1428	```
1429	
1430	### Lead Paragraph
1431	
1432	Opening paragraph styled distinctly from body text.
1433	
1434	```css
1435	/* Larger size */
1436	.lead {
1437	  font-size: 20px;
1438	  line-height: 1.6;
1439	  color: var(--text-bright);
1440	  margin-bottom: 32px;
1441	}
1442	
1443	/* With drop cap */
1444	.lead--dropcap::first-letter {
1445	  float: left;
1446	  font-family: var(--font-display);
1447	  font-size: 64px;
1448	  font-weight: 600;
1449	  line-height: 0.85;
1450	  padding-right: 12px;
1451	  padding-top: 6px;
1452	  color: var(--accent);
1453	}
1454	```
1455	
1456	### Pull Quotes
1457	
1458	Key insights pulled out for emphasis. Use sparingly — one or two per article maximum.
1459	
1460	```css
1461	/* Border left — most versatile */
1462	.pullquote {
1463	  margin: 48px 0;
1464	  padding-left: 24px;
1465	  border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
1466	}
1467	.pullquote p {
1468	  font-size: 22px;
1469	  font-style: italic;
1470	  line-height: 1.4;
1471	  color: var(--text-bright);
1472	  margin: 0;
1473	}
1474	
1475	/* Centered with quotation mark */
1476	.pullquote--centered {
1477	  margin: 56px 0;
1478	  padding: 32px 40px;
1479	  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
1480	  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
1481	  text-align: center;
1482	  position: relative;
1483	}
1484	.pullquote--centered::before {
1485	  content: '"';
1486	  position: absolute;
1487	  top: -12px;
1488	  left: 50%;
1489	  transform: translateX(-50%);
1490	  background: var(--bg);
1491	  padding: 0 16px;
1492	  font-family: var(--font-display);
1493	  font-size: 48px;
1494	  color: var(--accent);
1495	  line-height: 1;
1496	}
1497	```
1498	
1499	### Section Dividers
1500	
1501	```css
1502	/* Horizontal rule */
1503	hr {
1504	  border: none;
1505	  height: 1px;
1506	  background: var(--border);
1507	  margin: 48px 0;
1508	}
1509	
1510	/* Ornamental divider — use: <div class="divider">✦ ✦ ✦</div> */
1511	.divider {
1512	  text-align: center;
1513	  margin: 48px 0;
1514	  color: var(--text-dim);
1515	  font-size: 18px;
1516	  letter-spacing: 12px;
1517	}
1518	```
1519	
1520	### Article Hero Patterns
1521	
1522	```css
1523	/* Centered minimal — essays, personal posts */
1524	.hero--centered {
1525	  text-align: center;
1526	  padding: 80px 24px 64px;
1527	  max-width: 800px;
1528	  margin: 0 auto;
1529	}
1530	.hero__category {
1531	  font-size: 12px;
1532	  font-weight: 600;
1533	  text-transform: uppercase;
1534	  letter-spacing: 2px;
1535	  color: var(--accent);
1536	  margin-bottom: 16px;
1537	}
1538	.hero__title {
1539	  font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
1540	  font-weight: 600;
1541	  line-height: 1.15;
1542	  margin-bottom: 16px;
1543	}
1544	.hero__subtitle {
1545	  font-size: 20px;
1546	  font-style: italic;
1547	  color: var(--text-dim);
1548	  max-width: 600px;
1549	  margin: 0 auto 24px;
1550	}
1551	.hero__meta {
1552	  font-size: 13px;
1553	  color: var(--text-dim);
1554	}
1555	
1556	/* Left-aligned editorial — features, documentation */
1557	.hero--editorial {
1558	  padding: 100px 40px 60px;
1559	  max-width: 1000px;
1560	  margin: 0 auto;
1561	}
1562	.hero--editorial .hero__title {
1563	  font-size: clamp(40px, 7vw, 72px);
1564	  font-weight: 800;
1565	  line-height: 1.0;
1566	  letter-spacing: -2px;
1567	}
1568	```
1569	
1570	### Author Byline
1571	
1572	```css
1573	.byline {
1574	  display: flex;
1575	  align-items: center;
1576	  gap: 12px;
1577	  margin-top: 24px;
1578	}
1579	.byline__avatar {
1580	  width: 40px;
1581	  height: 40px;
1582	  border-radius: 50%;
1583	}
1584	.byline__name {
1585	  font-weight: 600;
1586	  color: var(--text-bright);
1587	  display: block;
1588	}
1589	.byline__meta {
1590	  font-size: 13px;
1591	  color: var(--text-dim);
1592	}
1593	```
1594	
1595	### Callout Boxes
1596	
1597	For warnings, tips, notes, and key takeaways.
1598	
1599	```css
1600	.callout {
1601	  padding: 16px 20px;
1602	  border-radius: 8px;
1603	  border-left: 4px solid var(--callout-border);
1604	  background: var(--callout-bg);
1605	  margin: 24px 0;
1606	}
1607	
1608	.callout--info {
1609	  --callout-border: var(--accent);
1610	  --callout-bg: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 10%, transparent);
1611	}
1612	
1613	.callout--warning {
1614	  --callout-border: var(--amber);
1615	  --callout-bg: color-mix(in srgb, var(--amber) 10%, transparent);
1616	}
1617	
1618	.callout--success {
1619	  --callout-border: var(--green);
1620	  --callout-bg: color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 10%, transparent);
1621	}
1622	
1623	.callout__title {
1624	  font-weight: 600;
1625	  margin-bottom: 8px;
1626	  color: var(--callout-border);
1627	}
1628	
1629	/* Lists inside callouts need padding fix */
1630	.callout ul, .callout ol {
1631	  padding-left: 1.5em;
1632	  margin: 8px 0 0 0;
1633	}
1634	```
1635	
1636	### Theme Toggle
1637	
1638	Use `data-theme` attribute for user-controllable light/dark modes. Random initial theme adds variety.
1639	
1640	```css
1641	:root, [data-theme="light"] {
1642	  --bg: #fafaf9;
1643	  --surface: #ffffff;
1644	  --text: #1c1917;
1645	  --text-dim: #78716c;
1646	  --border: #e7e5e4;
1647	  --accent: #0d9488;
1648	}
1649	
1650	[data-theme="dark"] {
1651	  --bg: #0c0a09;
1652	  --surface: #1c1917;
1653	  --text: #fafaf9;
1654	  --text-dim: #a8a29e;
1655	  --border: #292524;
1656	  --accent: #14b8a6;
1657	}
1658	```
1659	
1660	```javascript
1661	// Random initial theme
1662	const themes = ['light', 'dark'];
1663	document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', themes[Math.floor(Math.random() * 2)]);
1664	
1665	// Toggle function
1666	function toggleTheme() {
1667	  const current = document.documentElement.getAttribute('data-theme');
1668	  document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', current === 'light' ? 'dark' : 'light');
1669	}
1670	```
1671	
1672	```html
1673	<button class="theme-toggle" onclick="toggleTheme()" aria-label="Toggle theme">
1674	  <svg class="theme-toggle__sun" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
1675	    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><path d="M12 1v2M12 21v2M4.22 4.22l1.42 1.42M18.36 18.36l1.42 1.42M1 12h2M21 12h2M4.22 19.78l1.42-1.42M18.36 5.64l1.42-1.42"/>
1676	  </svg>
1677	  <svg class="theme-toggle__moon" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
1678	    <path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"/>
1679	  </svg>
1680	</button>
1681	```
1682	
1683	```css
1684	.theme-toggle {
1685	  position: fixed;
1686	  top: 20px;
1687	  right: 20px;
1688	  background: var(--surface);
1689	  border: 1px solid var(--border);
1690	  border-radius: 8px;
1691	  padding: 8px;
1692	  cursor: pointer;
1693	  z-index: 100;
1694	}
1695	[data-theme="light"] .theme-toggle__moon { display: none; }
1696	[data-theme="dark"] .theme-toggle__sun { display: none; }
1697	```
1698	
1699	### Prose Anti-Patterns
1700	
1701	Avoid these in reading-first content:
1702	- Body text smaller than 16px
1703	- Line-height below 1.5
1704	- Measure wider than 75ch (text spanning full viewport)
1705	- Pull quotes every other paragraph
1706	- Drop caps on every section
1707	- Busy background patterns behind text
1708	
1709	## Generated Images
1710	
1711	For AI-generated illustrations embedded as base64 data URIs via `surf gemini --generate-image`. Use sparingly — hero banners, conceptual illustrations, educational diagrams, decorative accents.
1712	
1713	### Hero Banner
1714	
1715	Full-width image cropped to a fixed height with a gradient fade into the page background. Place at the top of the page before the title, or between the title and the first content section.
1716	
1717	```css
1718	.hero-img-wrap {
1719	  position: relative;
1720	  border-radius: 12px;
1721	  overflow: hidden;
1722	  margin-bottom: 24px;
1723	}
1724	
1725	.hero-img-wrap img {
1726	  width: 100%;
1727	  height: 240px;
1728	  object-fit: cover;
1729	  display: block;
1730	}
1731	
1732	/* Gradient fade into page background */
1733	.hero-img-wrap::after {
1734	  content: '';
1735	  position: absolute;
1736	  bottom: 0;
1737	  left: 0;
1738	  right: 0;
1739	  height: 50%;
1740	  background: linear-gradient(to top, var(--bg), transparent);
1741	  pointer-events: none;
1742	}
1743	```
1744	
1745	```html
1746	<div class="hero-img-wrap">
1747	  <img src="data:image/png;base64,..." alt="Descriptive alt text">
1748	</div>
1749	```
1750	
1751	Generate with `--aspect-ratio 16:9` for hero banners.
1752	
1753	### Inline Illustration
1754	
1755	Centered image with border, shadow, and optional caption. Use within content sections for conceptual or educational illustrations.
1756	
1757	```css
1758	.illus {
1759	  text-align: center;
1760	  margin: 24px 0;
1761	}
1762	
1763	.illus img {
1764	  max-width: 480px;
1765	  width: 100%;
1766	  border-radius: 10px;
1767	  border: 1px solid var(--border);
1768	  box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
1769	}
1770	
1771	.illus figcaption {
1772	  font-family: var(--font-mono);
1773	  font-size: 11px;
1774	  color: var(--text-dim);
1775	  margin-top: 8px;
1776	}
1777	```
1778	
1779	```html
1780	<figure class="illus">
1781	  <img src="data:image/png;base64,..." alt="Descriptive alt text">
1782	  <figcaption>How the message queue routes events between services</figcaption>
1783	</figure>
1784	```
1785	
1786	Generate with `--aspect-ratio 1:1` or `--aspect-ratio 4:3` for inline illustrations.
1787	
1788	### Side Accent
1789	
1790	Small image floated beside a section. Use when the illustration supports but doesn't dominate the content.
1791	
1792	```css
1793	.accent-img {
1794	  float: right;
1795	  max-width: 200px;
1796	  margin: 0 0 16px 24px;
1797	  border-radius: 10px;
1798	  border: 1px solid var(--border);
1799	  box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
1800	}
1801	
1802	@media (max-width: 768px) {
1803	  .accent-img {
1804	    float: none;
1805	    max-width: 100%;
1806	    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
1807	  }
1808	}
1809	```
1810	
1811	```html
1812	<img class="accent-img" src="data:image/png;base64,..." alt="Descriptive alt text">
1813	```
1814

